{"unit_id": "tag:0DVG:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nTate的连续（continuous）上同调（cohomology）（<REF_0001>）由连续（continuous）非齐次（inhomogeneous）上链（cochains）的复形（complex）定义。当<MATH_0001>是任意赋有连续（continuous）<MATH_0002>-作用（action）的拓扑（topological）阿贝尔群（abelian group）时，可以作此定义。具体而言，考虑复形（complex）<MATH_0003>，其中边界（boundary）映射（map）对于<MATH_0004>由规则<MATH_0005>定义，而对于<MATH_0006>将<MATH_0007>送到映射（map）<MATH_0008>。我们定义<MATH_0009>。由于复形（complex）的各项（terms）涉及从<MATH_0010>以及<MATH_0011>的自积（self products）到拓扑（topological）模（module）<MATH_0012>的连续（continuous）映射（maps），尚不清楚这是否将拓扑（topological）模（modules）的短正合列（short exact sequence）变成一个长正合（long exact）上同调（cohomology）序列（sequence）。另一个困难是，拓扑（topological）阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的范畴（category）并不是阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）！\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n然而，离散（discrete）<MATH_0013>-模（modules）的短正合列（short exact sequence）确实给出连续（continuous）上链（cochains）的复形（complexes）的短正合列（short exact sequence），从而给出连续（continuous）上同调群（cohomology groups）<MATH_0014>的长正合（long exact）上同调（cohomology）序列（sequence）。因此，在定义<REF_0002>的范畴（category）<MATH_0015>上，函子（functors）<MATH_0016>构成《同调（Homology）》第<REF_0003>节定义的上同调（cohomological）<MATH_0017>-函子（functor）。由于定义<REF_0004>的上同调（cohomology）<MATH_0018>是一个普遍（universal）<MATH_0019>-函子（functor）（《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理<REF_0005>），得到典范（canonical）映射（maps）<MATH_0020>，对于<MATH_0021>。已知，当<MATH_0022>是抽象（abstract）群（group）（即<MATH_0023>带有离散（discrete）拓扑（topology））或当<MATH_0024>是预有限（profinite）群（group）时，这些映射（maps）是同构（isomorphisms）（在此插入今后的引用）。若你知道一个例子，表明这个映射（map）对于某个拓扑（topological）群（group）<MATH_0025>及<MATH_0026>不是同构（isomorphism），请发邮件至<TEXTOPEN_0001>stacks.project@gmail.com<TEXTCLOSE_0001>。\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Tate", "stacks.project", "gmail.com"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "inhomogeneous", "target_term": "非齐次"}, {"source_term": "cochains", "target_term": "上链"}, {"source_term": "complex", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "action", "target_term": "作用"}, {"source_term": "topological", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "complex", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "boundary", "target_term": "边界"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "complex", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "terms", "target_term": "项"}, {"source_term": "self products", "target_term": "自积"}, {"source_term": "topological", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "topological", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列"}, {"source_term": "long exact", "target_term": "长正合"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列"}, {"source_term": "topological", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "cochains", "target_term": "上链"}, {"source_term": "complexes", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "cohomology groups", "target_term": "上同调群"}, {"source_term": "long exact", "target_term": "长正合"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}